# Pages, scripts and styles recorded from a third-party site (replay, snapshot, profile modes) stay on this machine:
# the repository is public and those files are the site's own. This is an allow-list: everything here is ignored
# except this file, the README, the fake/ and recording/ folders, hand-written pages (*.synthetic.html one folder
# down) and JSON recorded from a public API (greenhouse/job.json). A new site needs no line to keep its recordings out.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/*/
/*/*
!/*/*.synthetic.html
!/greenhouse/job.json
!/fake/**
!/recording/**
